{"id": "q0100", "pool": "frozen", "arm": "local", "tier": "never", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 2864504703, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "923cbbdfe3213927dfa36b1f8e0eb48a30d641d9b9bf7cf25d16765340d88836", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": null, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 2, "query": "Let $P(x)$ be a monic polynomial of degree 3.  Suppose that $P(x)$ has remainder $R(x)$ when it is divided by $(x - 1)(x - 4),$ and remainder $2R(x)$ when it is divided by $(x - 2)(x - 3).$  Given that $P(0) = 5,$ find $P(5).$\n\nSolve and give the final answer.", "input_path": "/data/audio_pool/q0100.wav", "input_sha256": "ab5f7dfd82d334d2d9b35be513f0c0abf804686972b49c48cebc9877ea20b032", "input_samples": 271400, "input_s": 16.962, "n_real_chunks": 17, "score": 0.8999, "act": 0.9969, "is_info": true, "fired": false, "mode": "local", "answer": "All right, so we' re given that p of x is a monic polynomial of degree 3. That means it' s going to look like something like x cubed plus some other terms, but the leading coefficient is 1. And we're told that when p of x is divided by x minus 1 times x minus 4, which is a quadratic, the remainder is r of x. So this implies that p of x can be written as q of x times x minus 1 times x minus 4 plus r of x, where q of x is some polynomial and r of x is the remainder. Since the divisor is qua dratic, r of x must be linear or constant, so let's assume it' s linear for now. Similarly, when p of x is divided by x minus 3, the remainder is 2r of x. This gives us another equation: p of x equals s of x times x minus 3 plus 2 r of x, where s of x is another poly nomial.We also know that p of 0 equals 5. Let's use these pieces of information to find r of x first. Since the remainder when dividing by x minus 1 is r of x, plugging in x equals 1 into the first equation should give us r of 1. So p of 1 equals q of 1 times 1 minus 1 times 1 minus 4 plus r of 1. But 1 minus 1 is 0, so this simpl", "relay_text": "", "expert_answer": "", "transcript": "", "asr_s": null, "expert_s": null, "expert_input_samples": null, "expert_input_s": null, "expert_input_sha256": null, "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": null, "relay_synth_ms": null, "onset_chunk": 17, "eot_seen": false, "n_speak_chunks": 60, "feed_lag_max_ms": 0, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 0, "audio_files": {"local": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0100_local_local.wav", "sha256": "d7e3326cc4e9ecc6532acc699f63fff5476dd99da3f45f2a048bae04458b0d4b", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 60.0}}, "chunks": [[0, 1, 1.0, 1.061, 1.11, 1, 0, 0], [1, 1, 2.0, 2.061, 2.11, 1, 0, 0], [2, 1, 3.0, 3.061, 3.11, 1, 0, 0], [3, 1, 4.0, 4.061, 4.112, 1, 0, 0], [4, 1, 5.0, 5.063, 5.114, 1, 0, 0], [5, 1, 6.0, 6.063, 6.114, 1, 0, 0], [6, 1, 7.0, 7.063, 7.114, 1, 0, 0], [7, 1, 8.0, 8.072, 8.127, 1, 0, 0], [8, 1, 9.0, 9.064, 9.115, 1, 0, 0], [9, 1, 10.0, 10.064, 10.115, 1, 0, 0], [10, 1, 11.0, 11.065, 11.117, 1, 0, 0], [11, 1, 12.0, 12.065, 12.116, 1, 0, 0], [12, 1, 13.0, 13.065, 13.116, 1, 0, 0], [13, 1, 14.0, 14.065, 14.116, 1, 0, 0], [14, 1, 15.0, 15.065, 15.117, 1, 0, 0], [15, 1, 16.0, 16.065, 16.117, 1, 0, 0], [16, 1, 16.962, 17.028, 17.079, 1, 0, 0], [17, 0, 17.962, 18.029, 18.533, 0, 24000, 0], [18, 0, 18.962, 19.029, 19.733, 0, 24000, 0], [19, 0, 19.962, 20.037, 20.67, 0, 24000, 0], [20, 0, 20.962, 21.04, 21.75, 0, 24000, 0], [21, 0, 21.962, 22.041, 22.768, 0, 24000, 0], [22, 0, 22.962, 23.04, 23.714, 0, 24000, 0], [23, 0, 23.962, 24.031, 24.653, 0, 24000, 0], [24, 0, 24.962, 25.038, 25.736, 0, 24000, 0], [25, 0, 25.962, 26.032, 26.601, 0, 24000, 0], [26, 0, 26.962, 27.029, 27.673, 0, 24000, 0], [27, 0, 27.962, 28.038, 28.764, 0, 24000, 0], [28, 0, 28.962, 29.04, 29.769, 0, 24000, 0], [29, 0, 29.962, 30.029, 30.58, 0, 24000, 0], [30, 0, 30.962, 31.036, 31.709, 0, 24000, 0], [31, 0, 31.962, 32.031, 32.676, 0, 24000, 0], [32, 0, 32.962, 33.037, 33.68, 0, 24000, 0], [33